{
  "id": "git-config/prefix/pinned-against-a-hostile-configuration",
  "title": "A configuration that changes everything, and the options that pin the format anyway",
  "description": "color.diff=always, diff.noprefix, diff.mnemonicPrefix and diff.submodule=log are all set; --no-color --src-prefix=a/ --dst-prefix=b/ --submodule=short --no-ext-diff --no-textconv restore the classic output.",
